message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DIPESH — Detection and Imaging of Pbar Events, Spots and Hits"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-27
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23286325
authors:
  - family-names: "Bhanushali"
    given-names: "Dipesh"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2631-6684"
  - family-names: "Cerchiari"
    given-names: "Giovanni"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3068-0425"
abstract: >-
  Antiproton counting and data analysis tool, built by Dipesh Bhanushali.
  Desktop application and Python library for counting antiprotons in
  MCP / phosphor-screen camera images: spot detection, per-spot photometry
  and shape features, dataset comparison (separation score, PCA), parameter
  scans against the run parameters, and PicoScope pickup analysis with RF
  notch filtering.
keywords:
  - antiprotons
  - antimatter
  - image analysis
  - particle detection
  - MCP
